<title>USA: CME May pork bellies expire quietly unchanged.</title>
<headline>CME May pork bellies expire quietly unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>May pork belly futures on the Chicago Mercantile Exchange expired at 1200 CDT/1700 GMT Tuesday unchanged from Friday's close at 91.000 cents per lb.</p>
<p>Traders said activity in that contract was light throughout the morning and at expiration, the exchange estimated 23 contracts had traded for the day.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
